mapping "V8788.1" source="V8788" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8788 is the Swedish national 5th-character extension of ICD-10 V87.8 (45575835 SNOMED CT
        36198007), adding an activity suffix. The activity suffix is administrative Swedish context, not
        a clinical injury concept. The underlying base code V87.8 has an Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT
        444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, concept_code 36198007) — the only Maps-to
        target for V87.8. Target 444074 legitimately subsumes the source: the Swedish activity qualifier
        does not fall outside the target's clinical scope. broader/ : crosswalk-verified at base level,
        one-level subsumption of the activity suffix.
        """
}
